      "title": "Quantitative Research Intern - Summer 2027",
      "company_name": "Northwind Quant",
      "first_published": "2026-09-15T09:00:00-04:00",
      "content": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our London research team for a 10-12 week internship in Summer 2027 (June-September). You will research systematic trading signals alongside experienced quantitative researchers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#x27;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Analyse large financial time series datasets in Python&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prototype and backtest predictive signals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Present findings to the trading desk&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a degree in Mathematics, Physics, Engineering or Computer Science, graduating in 2027 or 2028&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of probability and statistics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Programming experience in Python or C++&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;",
